OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers save Peak District
OL,4,Aphoto archive from landfill fate
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Sheila McHale saw old photographs
OL,7,Fand papers documenting the history of
OL,8,Fthe Peak District National Park piled
OL,9,Fup in bin bags in a field, she knew she
OL,10,Fhad to save them.
OL,12,FSheila - a volunteer for the Peak
OL,13,FDistrict National Park Authority -
OL,14,Frescued what she could eight years ago
OL,15,Ffrom the barn clear-out, and kept them
OL,16,Fsafe in her shed, then loft, and later
OL,17,Fan airing cupboard.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
