OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers save Peak District
OL,4,Aphoto archive from landfill fate
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn June 2024, she and other volunteers
OL,7,Fstarted methodically working through
OL,8,Fthe material and a new home was found
OL,9,Ffor the collection at the national
OL,10,Fpark's head office in Bakewell.
OL,12,FThe team has since added to the archive
OL,13,Fand is hoping to find a home for this
OL,14,Ftreasure trove of information, with the
OL,15,Faim of creating an online resource.
